  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "說故事的魔法(二)",
    "sub_ename": "MAGIC OF STORYTELLING (2)",
    "describe_ch": "文學、視像與多媒體文本之閱讀與研習，培養對各種內容的鑑賞力與敏銳度，練習說故事的工具，包含體裁不限的文字與企劃腳本寫作，音樂、圖像與影片製作等內容創意。",
    "describe_eh": "To read and to study the literature, the image and the multimedia text is as to cultivate the sensibility and appreciation of the context in different platform. To practice every possible mean to narrate a story includes the copy writing, the production of music, video, and the other kinds of creative activities.",
